model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T, M2 C2, G2 (#164 R7, #163): before from: under flows (fl) and under bal (bl), for an instance dated before the scenario's from whose law date is after it (adv); a leg whose day is a window (advw) under windows each (blw)"

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input adv_day: date
input adv_law: date
input wd: date

move adv: transfers
  on adv_day
  at adv_law
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

move advw: transfers
  on wd
  at adv_law
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

version base
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "own"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version dates
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  adv_day = 2026-12-15 "own"
  adv_law = 2027-01-01 "own"
  wd = window(2026-12-20, 2026-12-28) "own"

ask fl: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2027-01-31) in late windows each
ask bl: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in late windows each
ask blw: bal(konto, 2026-12-24) in late windows each
ask bl_plain: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in late
